## 7. Safety & Security

### 7.1 General Safety Guidelines

| **Guideline** | **Description** |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Travel in pairs** | Never travel alone in the field |
| **Inform base** | Always inform base of your location and expected return time |
| **Carry communication** | Always carry a satellite phone or radio |
| **Know the area** | Be familiar with patrol areas and safe routes |
| **First aid** | Always carry a first aid kit |
| **Emergency contact** | Know emergency contact numbers |

### 7.2 Dangerous Animals

| **Animal** | **Safety Measures** |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Gorillas** | Observe from distance; do not approach; do not make sudden movements |
| **Elephants** | Observe from distance; do not approach; give space |
| **Snakes** | Watch where you step; do not disturb |
| **Hippos** | Keep distance; do not approach water bodies |

### 7.3 Illegal Activities

If you encounter illegal activities (poaching, logging, mining):

| **Do** | **Do Not** |
| :--- | :--- |
| ✅ Record location and details | ❌ Do not engage directly |
| ✅ Report to base immediately | ❌ Do not confront armed individuals |
| ✅ Document with photographs if safe | ❌ Do not put yourself at risk |
| ✅ Follow standard operating procedures | ❌ Do not act alone |

